            <ArticleTitle>Assessing children's pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1046-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Children's experience of pain is difficult to assess. A number of tools are available that enable children's pain to be measured. If these are used appropriately, practitioners can set measurable goals for pain relief and evaluate their interventions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
